# X part 5c — the image build context (repository root) never carries secrets, data or build output.
# Docker's patterns are root-anchored: `**/` is what reaches infra/docker/.env and every package.
.git
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/data/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/coverage/
**/.turbo/
**/reports/
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.dump
**/*.bak
**/*.tgz
**/id_*
!**/id_*.ts
!**/id_*.tsx
**/*.sql.gz
.claude/settings.local.json
**/build/
**/.stryker-tmp/
**/playwright-report/
**/test-results/
